    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Lt coronary a.:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " supplies the Lt atrium, Lt ventricle and IVS; its branches are the circumflex (along the coronary sulcus to the Lt) and the anterior interventricular a. (LAD)."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
